#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn how to install the development version of the Qiskit Runtime client."
msgstr ""
"Découvrez comment installer la version de développement du client Qiskit "
"Runtime."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Runtime client from source"
msgstr "Installer le client Qiskit Runtime depuis les sources"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the Qiskit Runtime client from source {#install-the-qiskit-runtime-"
"client-from-source}"
msgstr ""
"Installer le client Qiskit Runtime depuis les sources {#install-the-qiskit-"
"runtime-client-from-source}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When you install Qiskit Runtime from source, you can access the current "
"development version, instead of using the version in the Python Package "
"Index (PyPI) repository. You can therefore inspect and extend the latest "
"version of the code more efficiently.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lorsque tu installes Qiskit Runtime depuis les sources, tu peux accéder à la"
" version de développement actuelle, au lieu d'utiliser la version du "
"référentiel Python Package Index (PyPI). Tu peux donc inspecter et étendre "
"plus efficacement la dernière version du code.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create and activate a new virtual environment {#create-and-activate-a-new-"
"virtual-environment}"
msgstr ""
"Créer et activer un nouvel environnement virtuel {#create-and-activate-a-"
