#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Runtime {#install-qiskit-runtime}"
msgstr "Installer Qiskit Runtime {#install-qiskit-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to install Qiskit Runtime:\n"
msgstr "Suis ces étapes pour installer Qiskit Runtime :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the Qiskit Runtime repository.\n"
msgstr "Clone le dépôt Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Change to the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` directory.\n"
msgstr "Change vers le répertoire `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install `qiskit-runtime`. We recommend using a [virtual "
"environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting"
" your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Installe `qiskit-runtime`. Nous recommandons d'utiliser un [environnement "
"virtuel](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) pour éviter de polluer"
" ton installation Python globale.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Standard install**:\n"
msgstr "**Installation standard** :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Editable mode**: In this mode, you don't need to reinstall Qiskit when "
"there are code changes to the project.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mode éditable** : Dans ce mode, tu n'as pas besoin de réinstaller Qiskit "
"lorsqu'il y a des modifications de code dans le projet.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    In editable mode, the compiled extensions are built in _debug mode_ "
"without optimizations.\n"
msgstr ""
"    En mode éditable, les extensions compilées sont construites en _mode "
"débogage_ sans optimisations.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(Optional) If you want to run tests or linting checks, install the developer"
" requirements. We recommend using a [virtual "
"environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting"
" your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr ""
"(Facultatif) Si tu veux exécuter des tests ou des vérifications de "
"formatage, installe les dépendances de développement. Nous recommandons "
"d'utiliser un [environnement "
"virtuel](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) pour éviter de polluer"
" ton installation Python globale.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Étapes suivantes {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Read the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) to contribute to `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommandations\">\n"
"  - Lis les [directives de contribution](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) pour contribuer à `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Installer le SDK Qiskit depuis les sources](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Exécuter ton premier programme](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Essaie un tutoriel, comme [l'algorithme de Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
